                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "// Read input from workflow variable into a CODE local variable called skillsArray\nlet skillsArray = $context.$variables.SkillsInput.skillsToProcess\n\n// add disposition \nskillsArray[$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_SKILL.$currentItemIndex].dispositionMethod = \"ORA_HRT_SYNONYM\" ;\n\n// add reason\nskillsArray[$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_SKILL.$currentItemIndex].reason = $context.$variables.ReasonByLLM; \n\n// add matching content item id\nskillsArray[$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_SKILL.$currentItemIndex].matchingSkillCatalogItemId = $context.$variables.SynonymMatchContentItemId;\n\n// add matching skill name\nskillsArray[$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_SKILL.$currentItemIndex].matchingSkill= $context.$variables.SynonymMatchSkillName; \n\nreturn skillsArray[$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_SKILL.$currentItemIndex];"
                  },
